{"query":"upcoming projects near Marina64 Malad West","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://housing.com/in/buy/mumbai/malad-west-gid/projects","title":"New Projects in Malad West, Mumbai for Sale - Housing","content":"Housing.com has 850+ new and upcoming projects in Malad West, spanning 46+ pre-launch and 193+ under-construction. Marina 64 Phase 3 (729 sq.ft) There are 632","score":0.87681407,"raw_content":null,"id":"76e910-00"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/mahindra-marina-64-malad-west-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r446737","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West, Mumbai is New Launch project. Construction-linked Plan 3 Bedrooms Amenities. There are 382 residential projects in Malad West.","score":0.8332299,"raw_content":null,"id":"95ccb9-01"},{"url":"https://www.mahindrahome.com/project/mahindra-marina-64/index.html","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West | 2 and 3 BHK","content":"Mahindra Marina 64 is a new launch residential project developed by Mahindra Lifespaces. This is an exclusive new launch residential project strategically located in the heart of Malad West, Mumbai. Crafted for discerning home buyers and forward-looking property investors, this premium development offers the perfect balance of urban convenience and serene luxury living.\n\nSet amidst one of Mumbai’s most vibrant neighbourhoods, Mahindra Lifespaces Marina 64 presents spacious and elegantly designed 2 and 3 BHK apartments, starting at ₹2.61 Cr\\. The homes are thoughtfully laid out with smart space utilization — 758 sq. ft. for 2 BHK and 967 sq. ft. for 3 BHK — offering the comfort of expansive living areas and natural light. [...] Mahindra Lifespaces Malad West Logo\n\n# Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is a new launch residential project developed by Mahindra Lifespaces. This is an exclusive new launch residential project strategically located in the heart of Malad West, Mumbai. Crafted for discerning home buyers and forward-looking property investors, this premium development offers the perfect balance of urban convenience and serene luxury living.\n\nSet amidst one of Mumbai’s most vibrant neighbourhoods, Mahindra Lifespaces Marina 64 presents spacious and elegantly designed 2 and 3 BHK apartments, starting at ₹2.61 Cr\\. The homes are thoughtfully laid out with smart space utilization — 758 sq. ft. for 2 BHK and 967 sq. ft. for 3 BHK — offering the comfort of expansive living areas and natural light. [...] Wide internal roads, clearly demarcated pedestrian zones, green zones, and recreational areas are strategically placed across the development to provide a premium lifestyle experience. The entire layout reflects a community-centric approach, offering thoughtfully located amenity zones and leisure spaces that encourage relaxation, fitness, and social interaction among residents. From children's play areas to open green gardens and clubhouse zones, every element of the master plan reflects Mahindra Lifespace commitment to sustainable, luxurious, and holistic living in the heart of Malad West.\n\nYou can also check other residential projects by Mahindra Group -\n Meridian Alibaug,\n Alcove Chandivali,\n Happinest Kalyan,\n Lifespaces Pimpri,\n Roots Kandivali and\n Tathawade Pune.","score":0.7971311,"raw_content":null,"id":"c7c98d-02"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/new-launch-projects-in-malad-west-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-ffid","title":"New Launch Projects in Malad West, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"New Launch Projects in Malad West Mumbai ; Mahindra Marina 64. Malad West, Western Mumbai. ₹37.5K/sqft onwards. ~ (carpet area). 2BHK. ₹2.85 Cr. 3BHK. ₹3.69","score":0.7923522,"raw_content":null,"id":"d16208-03"},{"url":"https://housing.com/in/buy/projects/page/357808-mahindra-marina-64-phase-3-by-mahindra-lifespaces-in-malad-west","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 Phase 3 in Malad West, Mumbai - Housing","content":"Mahindra Ma